   LoGGo is a _VERY_ simple login lottery for TechnoBBS. LoGGo is FREEWARE,
 so you may copy and distribute it freely, but NO charges may be taken for
 distribution. Remember, You use this little toy at your own risk! I Do NOT
 take any responsability! 	   

  The installation is very simple too:

 1.  Copy the files (LoGGo.rexx, LoGGo.doc) to your Doors: directory. (Or
    where ever you want).
 
 2.  Add this command somewhere after the command "DoneLogOn", in your 
    BBSLogOn.rexx File:		

     Call 'BBS:Doors/LoGGo.rexx' ln
 
 3. And that's all!  	 	     

